---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`${SITE_NAMES[lang]} legal notice: publisher, host and terms of use 2026`} description="Publisher and host of Bridge to 59, an independent site not affiliated with the IRS or any plan; calculations are general information, not financial, tax or investment advice." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-serif">
    <h1>Legal notice and terms of use</h1>
    <p>Information given under Article 6 III-1 of French law no. 2004-575 of 21 June 2004, the publisher being established in France.</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Publication director: {AUTHOR_NAME}, responsible for the content of {SITE_URL}.</p>
    <h2>Host</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>Independent site</h2>
    <p>{SITE_NAMES[lang]} is a private publication. It is not run, endorsed or paid for by the Internal Revenue Service, the Department of Health and Human Services, a state government, a retirement plan, a broker or a financial adviser.</p>
    <h2>General information, not advice</h2>
    <p>The pages describe federal and state rules and the calculators apply them to the figures you type, with assumptions you choose. Nothing here is personal financial, tax, legal or investment advice, a recommendation to retire, to buy or sell a security, or to take a distribution. Your plan document and your tax return decide what applies to you; a plan administrator or a tax professional can confirm it.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2><p>Rules and rates are read on official texts and the calculators are tested before each release, but rules change and errors cannot be excluded. The publisher is not liable for a decision taken on the basis of the site alone. Errors can be reported through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2><p>Texts, design and code belong to the publisher; short quotations with a link are welcome. Federal government texts quoted here are in the public domain.</p>
    <h2>Embedding</h2><p>The FIRE calculator may be embedded for free with its credit line visible: see the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Personal data</h2><p>No cookie, nothing kept of what you type: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>, <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a>.</p>
    <h2>Reporting unlawful content</h2><p>Write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> with the page address.</p>
    <h2>Governing law</h2><p>French law applies; failing an amicable settlement, the courts of {LEGAL.jurisdiction} have jurisdiction. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
